<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DJ Lucxy | Official Website & Mixtapes</title>
    <style>
        /* --- Root Variables & Reset --- */
        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0a0a0c;
            --bg-secondary: #141519;
            --card-bg: #1e1f26;
            --accent-glow: #00f2fe;
            --accent-purple: #4facfe;
            --text-main: #f1f1f1;
            --text-muted: #a0a0a6;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* --- Navigation --- */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1.5rem 8%;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.9);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent-glow), var(--accent-purple));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 2rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-glow);
        }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 6rem 1rem 4rem;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(0,242,254,0.1) 0%, rgba(10,10,12,1) 70%);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent-glow), var(--accent-purple));
            color: #000;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.4);
        }

        /* --- Sections Layout --- */
        section {
            padding: 4rem 8%;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            bottom: -5px;
            width: 50%;
            height: 3px;
            background: var(--accent-glow);
        }

        /* --- Mixtapes Grid --- */
        .mixtape-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .mixtape-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .mixtape-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .cover-art {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
        }

        .mixtape-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .mixtape-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        audio {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        /* --- Contact / Booking --- */
        .contact-container {
            background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        /* --- Footer --- */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">DJ LUCXY</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#mixtapes">Mixtapes</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#contact">Bookings</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>DJ LUCXY</h1>
        <p>Official Mixes • Live Sets • Sound Waves</p>
        <a href="#mixtapes" class="btn">Listen Now</a>
    </section>

    <section id="mixtapes">
        <h2 class="section-title">Latest Mixtapes</h2>
        <div class="mixtape-grid">

            <div class="mixtape-card">
                <div class="cover-art">Album Cover Placeholder 1</div>
                <h3>Summer Vibe Mix Vol. 1</h3>
                <p>An energetic blend of Afrobeat, Amapiano, and Club hits.</p>
                <audio controls>
                    <source src="your-mixtape-1.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                    Your browser does not support the audio element.
                </audio>
            </div>

            <div class="mixtape-card">
                <div class="cover-art">Album Cover Placeholder 2</div>
                <h3>Midnight Chill Mix</h3>
                <p>Deep house vibes perfect for late night study or chill sessions.</p>
                <audio controls>
                    <source src="your-mixtape-2.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                    Your browser does not support the audio element.
                </audio>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
        <h2 class="section-title">About DJ Lucxy</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 700px;">
            Welcome to the official hub for DJ Lucxy! Bringing heat to the turntables with high-energy mixes, seamless transitions, and diverse genres. Check out the latest tapes above and stay tuned for live show updates.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Bookings & Inquiries</h2>
        <div class="contact-container">
            <form action="#" method="POST">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Name</label>
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Email</label>
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Message / Event Details</label>
                    <textarea rows="4" placeholder="Tell me about your event..." required></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn" style="border: none; width: 100%; cursor: pointer;">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 DJ Lucxy. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
